This templates is used to display an icon identifying [[{{{2}}}]] stations. It can be abbreviated {{tlx|{{{1}}}}}.

* The first parameter is the station number.
* The second parameter sets the size of the logos in pixels. If this parameter is omitted, the default pixel size is 30 pixels.

